  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PFM demand side support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PFM demand side support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Budget Partnership (IBP) har ans&#xf6;kt om st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida om totalt 5 000 000 SEK f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra IBP landstrategi f&#xf6;r Kenya med fokus p&#xe5; budgettransparens 2013-2015. Insatsen syftar till att &#xf6;ka efterfr&#xe5;gan p&#xe5; transparens av statsbudgeten, och anv&#xe4;ndandet av budgetanalyser i offentliga debatter, &#xf6;ka utbudet av budgetinformation, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra budgettransparensen p&#xe5; l&#xe4;nsniv&#xe5; och st&#xf6;dja transitionsprocessen till ett decentraliserat system.  
Den totala budgeten f&#xf6;r 2013-2015 &#xe4;r 1 741 215 USD av vilket Sida finansierar 699 660 USD, Gates foundation 955 880 USD och Omidyar 85 675 USD.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Budget Partnership (IBP) has requested for support from Sida totalling 5 000 000 SEK for the implementation of its Kenya Strategy 2013-2015 focusing on budget transparency. The purpose is to increase the demand for transparency of the state budget, increase the use of budget analysis in public debate, increase the supply fo budget information, improve the budget transparency at county level and support the devolution process. The total budget 2013-2015 is 1 714 215 USD of which Sida finances 699 660 USD, Gates Foundation 955 880 USD and Omidyar 85 675 USD.</narrative>
  </description>
